This product includes system prompt text copied verbatim from ZCode
(https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode), commit
fec975905a2abd4c07e35c40d51fa097a2258ec9 (sync v3.18.2). That code is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The persona in src/context/index.ts copies three blocks from
apps/zcode-cli/packages/core/src/context/sections/identity.ts in that commit:

  src/context/index.ts (the PERSONA constant)
    identity.ts DEFAULT_AGENT_IDENTITY (the stable agent intro)
    identity.ts SECURITY_NOTICE (the security notice)
    identity.ts buildHarnessBlock (the "# Harness" block, in its
      mid-conversation `<system-reminder>` variant)

The remaining persona and prompt text in this package is original work.

The behavior this preset reproduces was otherwise designed by reading the
ZCode source. Reading informed the design; beyond the persona blocks above,
no ZCode source code, prompt text or documentation is copied or ported. The
upstream source references are in the tool, compression and memory guides.

This package is written against the DeepSeek Harness plugin API. The API type
declarations used at build time come from the installed DeepSeek Harness
packages and are not redistributed here.

The Apache License 2.0 text is in LICENSE.
